# Judge1-4-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR15,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ノアさんを殺した凶器について<br>もう一度詳しく<br>考えてみましょうか！|#0101Trial04_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……なんか話し合う<br>必要あるのか？<br>さっき桜羽と宝生が<br>話してただろ……。<br>あの矢が城ケ崎を<br>殺した凶器だってな。|#0101Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:部屋に転がってた矢……<br>ですわね？<br>これを胸に刺されて<br>ノアさんは<br>死んだんですわよね……？|#0101Trial04_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL14,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だ、だとしたら<br>犯人はその矢を<br>どうやって<br>刺したんでしょうか……？|#0101Trial04_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL14,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:部屋の中は<br>白一色で塗られていて、<br>そこには足跡も<br>ありませんでした。|#0101Trial04_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"そりゃ<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_04_01\">遠くから投げつけた</link>んじゃ<br>ねーのか。<br>犯人は<link=\"Objection_01_01_04_02\">ダーツの経験</link>でも<br>あったんだろ。|#0101Trial04_Alisa002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"矢を部屋の<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_04_03\">外から投げ込んだ</link>だけ……<br>単純でシンプルな答えだ。|#0101Trial04_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……ダーツで人殺しとか、<br>それ本気で言ってる？<br>頭ヤンキー過ぎん？|#0101Trial04_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:仮の話だっての……！<br>とりあえず仮定として<br>進めてんだよ！<br>文句があるならお前が仕切れ！|#0101Trial04_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

